      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "A WISH GRANTED (7) has been racing well of late. Finished third at his latest appearance over 1770m at this track, beaten 5 metres when trying to lead all of the way. Drawn to enjoy a soft trip but might need things to go his way at some stage. Meets a similar line up and he is a strong winning hope. SUMMER PUNCH (9) is in good form having placed in the top-three in all of her last three runs, most recently recording a third over 1710m at Goulburn after racing three-back on the fence for most of the trip. Will need an ounce of luck to slot in from this tricky draw but won't find this line-up any harder and she can get the job done. SHE SHIMMERS (6) is having her fifth run this prep and should be at her peak for this. Finished third over 1740m at Riverina Paceway last start after racing outside the leader at the bell. Sure to give the top fancies plenty to think about. DUNNA HAMMY (1) is worth some thought despite his last-start eighth over 2100m at Young on September 15.",
